Swarini Hindi TTS: provenance and attribution

This project is a Hindi adaptation that substantially reuses and modifies the
training and inference implementation of Paradee by Sahil Mahendrakar:

  https://github.com/sahilmahendrakar/paradee

The original paper citation and upstream link are provided in MODEL_CARD.md and
README.md. The upstream source and this adaptation are distributed under
Apache-2.0. This project is not an official Paradee release and is not endorsed
by its author.

Swarini also uses Kokoro-82M as its frozen teacher and Misaki for phonemization.
The Hindi text corpus is derived from AI4Bharat IndicCorpV2. Their own notices
and dataset terms remain applicable; see README.md and training/data/README.md.
